    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe eard wylle rihtlice clænsian ⁊ unriht alecgan ⁊ rihtwisnysse lufian, ðonne mot he georne ðyllices steoran ⁊ ðyllic ascunian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who desires to purify the land aright and to suppress injustice and cherish righteousness must zealously prohibit and avoid those crimes.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe eard wylle rihtlice clænsian ⁊ unriht alecgan ⁊ rihtwisnesse lufian, þonne mot he georne þyllices styran ⁊ þyllic ascunian.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
